STRING 300
{
New Commands
}

STRING 301
{
|c00FFFF0024/7 MEC assistance by Stan. Type -help [keyword] enter (example: -help slide). 
|c00FF0000Commands explained: |c0020C000lc, m, fm, fpc, ot, idm, sn, monk.


|c00FFFF00-lockCamera(lc on/off/1-24)|r
Temporarily locks your camera to any desired player

|c00FFFF00-mirror (m on/off)|r
Mirror the corresponded slide speed into reverse / non-reverse.

|c00FFFF00-followMouse (fm on/off)|r
Follow mouse mode: get an APM of 600 without the pain of clicking. This unfortunately triggers an additional ping 

|c00FFFF00-firstPersonCamera (fpc on/off)|r
Pog ._z Liding

|c00FFFF00-othersTransparency (ot 0-100)|r
Trouble finding yourself? Partially remove your comrades from the equation.

|c00FFFF00-ignoreDeathMessages (idm on/off)|r
Stops death messages from being displayed. 

|c00FFFF00-showNames (sn on/off) |r
Display player names to all heroes.

|c00FFFF00-hideChat (hc | monk on/off) |r
Disables pop-chat. Read messages only in F12. 
}

STRING 302
{
Old Commands
}

STRING 303
{
|c00FFFF00Commands that have existed and worked for long over a decade.
|c00FF0000Commands explained: |c0020C000cf, rc, rci, ldb, an, clr, apm, mnbm, lnbm|r


|c00FFFF00-cameraField(cf) <value>|r
Set the camera to any desired height. Ex: -cf 2800.

|c00FFFF00-resetCamera(rc)|r
Puts the camera back to the previously chosen field

|c00FFFF00-resetCameraInit(rci)|r
Changes the camera field back to its default value (2500)

|c00FFFF00-leaderboard(ldb) on|off|r
Displays or hides the entire leaderboard

|c00FFFF00-animation(an) <string>|r
Makes your hero doing an animation. ex : -an attack

|c00FFFF00-clearText(clr)|r
Removes the text on the screen

|c00FFFF00-apm(-) [all|a]|r
Displays apm on slide of everybody or just yourself

|c00FFFF00-mapNbMonsters(mnbm)|r
Displays the number of monsters in the map, of the chosen kind. \"Moving\" is the default kind. ex : -mnbm nm

|c00FFFF00-levelNbMonsters(lnbm)|r
Displays the number of monsters in the current level, of the chosen kind
}

STRING 304
{
Red Commands
}

STRING 305
{
|c00FFFF00Commands explained:|r|c00FF0000 
-noobedit, -speededit, -kl, kc, restart|r
|c00FFFF00You may refer any punished players as: 
|r|c00FF0000Number (2 - 24), Color (Blue - Peanut), Name (Shortened - Exact)|r

|c0020C000-noobedit (on/off)|r
Gives you infinite lives and instant respawn.

|c0020C000-speededit (on/off)|r
Be like Stan. Go fast. 

|c0020C000-kill <Pcolor> <Pnumber> <Pname>|r
examples : -kill blue,  -kl yw, -kl 23, -kl JellyBeans

|c0020C000-kick <Pcolor> <Pnumber> <Pname>|r
examples : -kick blue,  -kc yw, -kc 11, -kc Bonnick

|c0020C000-restart|r
" just restart the game like when lose you little noob "
This also allows for a re-selection on the various game modes.
}

STRING 306
{
Colors
}

STRING 307
{
|c00FF0060Commands explained:|c0020C000 <color>, d, vc, wild, nv, ci. 
Colors: |c00FF0303rd, |c000042FFbe, |c001CE6B9tl, |c00540081pe, |c00FFFC01yw, |c00fEBA0Eoe,|c0020C000 gn, |c00E55BB0pk, |c00959697gy, |c007EBFF1lb, |c00106246dg, |c004E2A04bn, |cff9c0000mrn, |cff0000c3ny, |cff00ebfftqe, |cffbd00ffvlt, |cffecce87wht, |cfff7a58bph, |cffbfff81mint,|cffdbb8eb lvr, |cff4f5055coal,|cffecf0ff snw,|cff00781e emd, |cffa56f34pnt

|c000042FF-<color>
change the base color of your character

|c001CE6B9-disco(d) [off|1~30]
chooses the number of color changes in ten seconds, or stop color changing.

|c00540081-vertexColor [ <red> <green> <blue> [<transparency>] ]
alias -vc, change the vertex color of you character.

|c00FF1323-W|c32BB2142i|c58BB3462l|c58FB3467d|r
|c00FF0000Rand|c00FF1323omize |c32BB2142your |c58BB3462vertex |c58FB3467color|r

|c00FFFC01-noVertex
alias -nv, cancel the vertex color of your character
it's like -vc 100 100 100

|c00FF9696-colorInfo [<Pcolor>]
alias -ci, display info about base color and vertex color of a hero
}

STRING 308
{
MapDescription
}

STRING 309
{
This map was made with Max Escape Creation 2.
Make a map without the need of using the World Editor

https://mec.maxslid.com/
https://discord.gg/N8QwwFTcYJ
}

STRING 324
{
Effects
}

STRING 325
{
|c00FFFF00Apply effects to your demon hunters various body parts.|r

|cff20c000The effects are:|r [l]ight, [f]ire, [i]ce, [c]orrupution, [p]oison, [s]low.
|cff20c000The body parts are:|r [l]eft[h]and, [r]ight[h]and, [l]eft[f]oot, [r]ight[f]oot, [o]ver[h]ead, [h]ead, [o]rigin, [c]hest.

|c00FFFF00-effect <effect>|r
alias -ef, puts an effect on each hand of your hero

|c00FFFF00-customEffect <effect> <bodyPart>|r
alias -ce, specify any effect towards desired bodypart.

|c00FFFF00-effectsEverywhere <effect>|r
alias -efe, puts the same effect to each body part of your hero

|c00FFFF00-deleteEffects [<numberOfEffectsToRemove n>]|r
alias -de, deletes the n last effects of your hero, all effects if no parameter specified

}

